            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20400405?u=075e959e77a07eaca03dd4c0dd78eb43333b3525&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4957017490\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/issues/686\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/polkit-org/polkit/issues/686/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/issues/686\">polkit-org/polkit#686</a> for the original upstream issue and <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5121538724\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/issues/693\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/polkit-org/polkit/pull/693/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/polkit-org/polkit/pull/693\">polkit-org/polkit#693</a> the PR from which the local patch was backported.</p>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"ch