        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71162231?u=d5f213ce7bcea93780c63246913ab4f129dc8728&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">dhcpcd runs as the unprivileged <code class=\"notranslate\">dhcpcd</code> user and passes DNS servers to systemd-resolved over D-Bus. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2769005596\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/370971\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/370971/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/370971\">#370971</a> added polkit rules to allow that, but the module never enables polkit, which is off by default. On hosts where nothing else enables it (headless servers, for example), every lease logs <code class=\"notranslate\">Failed to set DNS configuration: Access denied</code> and resolved receives no DNS servers from DHCP or router advertisements.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This enables polkit with <code class=\"notranslate\">mkDefault</code> when dhcpcd and resolved are both in use. <code class=\"notranslate\">security.polkit.enable = false</code> still opts out. Hostname-only setups (<code class=\"notranslate\">networking.dhcpcd.setHostname</code>) are unchanged; they already document that they need polkit.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The new <code class=\"notranslate\">dhcpResolved</code> test runs a client with DHCP and resolved, without enabling polkit, and waits for the router's DNS server to reach resolved. dhcpcd replaces the DHCPv4 server with the router-advertised IPv6 server about 80 ms later, so the test accepts either one. Both reach resolved only through polkit.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Without the module change: the test times out after 900 s, and dhcpcd logs <code class=\"notranslate\">Access denied</code>.</li>\n<li>With it: the test passes in about 20 s. It passes in both the <code class=\"notranslate\">scripted</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">networkd</code> variants, and <code class=\"notranslate\">scripted.dhcpHostname</code> still passes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #569970.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5693688297\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/569970\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/569970/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/569970\">#569970</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>: <code class=\"notranslate\">nixosTests.networking.{scripted,networkd}.dhcpResolved</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">nixosTests.networking.scripted.dhcpHostname</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Disclosure: an AI assistant wrote the code, the test and this description (pi, claude-opus-5-5; the review pass used gpt-6-astra). The test was checked to fail without the fix and pass with it. This is a draft until I have reviewed it myself; I will mark it ready after that. I hit the original bug on an aarch64 Raspberry Pi 5 running NixOS 26.11, and enabling polkit there fixed it.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/569997",
            "title": "nixos/dhcpcd: enable polkit with systemd-resolved",
            "date_modified": "2026-10-15T14:24:25.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-10-03T23:52:47.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "chenxin-yan",
                "url": "https://github.com/chenxin-yan"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22363274?u=daa3405e66b1c6ac908bb46e558e2aa744388220&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">polkit-agent-helper@</code> only got <code class=\"notranslate\">/dev/hidraw*</code> when <code class=\"notranslate\">security.pam.u2f.enable</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">security.pam.yubico.enable</code> was set globally. With U2F enabled only for polkit (<code class=\"notranslate\">security.pam.services.polkit-1.u2f.enable = true</code>), pam_u2f could not reach the key and polkit fell back to the password.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The sandbox overrides now follow the polkit-1 PAM service, which is what the helper runs. Follow-up to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3883025384\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/486044\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/486044/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/486044\">#486044</a> and <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/commit/c8068a40582768ce6d73b798f62985a197eca463/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/commit/c8068a40582768ce6d73b798f62985a197eca463\"><tt>c8068a4</tt></a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixosTests.pam-u2f-polkit</code> covers U2F enabled globally, only for polkit-1, and globally with polkit-1 opted out. Both new cases fail without the module change.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This change, its test, the commit message and this description were drafted with DeepSeek Harness (claude-opus-5-5) and reviewed by me before submission.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/585509",
